ore a massive payday!<br>\u30fbCollect golden maps to reach the legendary ruins &quot;Gol Dorado&quot; and claim the hidden treasure, Viva La Vida!<br>\u30fbFind the sneaky NPC Androids pretending to be NOBOTS!<br>\u30fbChange avatar type<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About \u201cPrivate Match\u201d (Test Version)</h2> This mode allows up to 16 players to play together with people they know.  <br>Treasures and medals collected in this mode cannot be taken back to the main game.  <br>Wins and losses do not affect experience points or rank, making it perfect for practice.  <br>Room time limit: 30 minutes.<br>Note: Inconvenient features in this test version are planned to be improved in the final version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Network Settings</h2>You can change the server region from the sub-menu. <br>Try this if your connection or matchmaking is unstable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/a632bf3502bde025385d2b51d4821871.avif?t=1749476913\" width=520 height=374 /></span>",
